    "detailed_description": "A game that was inspired in bootlegs, most graphics made from scratch, and obviously, an original story, <br>masplado is a plataform game with in total 33 levels (without counting the sub-levels) and 7 worlds<br>the gameplay is a little complicated for those who are not so expert in games with hard levels<br><br>also, the game have a big variety of enemies and backgrounds.<br><br><br><strong>some observations:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> the menu is very simple<br></li><li> in the options screen have all the guide to how to play<br></li><li> the game is saved automatically <br></li><li> this game was made for teenagers and adults, it's not recommended for children <br>(because of the dark humor jokes and minor details that are not appropriate for children)</li></ul>",
